{- A 300-alternative structural sum. A value of one alternative flows
   through an identity function into a consumer whose row lists the same
   300 alternatives in the opposite order, and a 300-arm case dispatches
   on it. Confirms a wide structural row unifies regardless of label order
   and that tag dispatch still selects the right arm. Prints `1`. -}

